      "title": "Live demo: the 2 GB micro model",
      "properties": {
        "widget_ue_connectable": {}
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Micro LCM \u2014 fast text-to-image for live demos\n\n**DreamShaper 8 LCM** is a 2.0 GiB fp16 Stable Diffusion 1.5 checkpoint with LCM distillation baked in. It loads from the same `models/checkpoints` folder as the big models, but needs only **4 steps at 512 \u00d7 512**.\n\n- sampler `lcm`, scheduler `normal`, cfg `2.0`, 4 steps\n- one image takes roughly a second on the RTX 3070 Ti (first run includes the model load)\n- outputs are saved to `outputs/micro/`\n\nUse `scripts/run_micro.py` for a prompt grid with per-prompt timings, or queue this graph for a one-image live demo. Raise the batch size on `EmptyLatentImage` to show several variations per prompt."
      ]
    }
